	&lt;element name="Death’s Threshold" type="Class Feature" source="The Spiritualist" id="ID_DMSG_HSPRT_CLASS_FEATURE_SPIRITUALIST_DEATHS_THRESHOLD"&gt;
		&lt;description&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;At 1st level, your psychic abilities stem from the cause of your near death experience, called a threshold: beast &amp;amp; briar, bloody blade, or plague &amp;amp; poison, each of which is detailed at the end of the class description. Your choice grants you features at 1st level and again at 6th, and 14th level.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/description&gt;
		&lt;sheet display="false" /&gt;
		&lt;rules&gt;
			&lt;select type="Archetype" name="Death’s Thresholds" supports="Spiritualist Deaths Thresholds" /&gt;
