			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sense Shame.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; When you make a Wisdom (Insight) ability check to understand a creature’s self-hatred, you can spend 1 ectoplasm point to gain advantage on that ability check.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;p class="indent"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toxic Shame.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; You can use a bonus action and spend 2 ectoplasm points to choose a creature within 60 feet that you can see. Until the start of your next turn, the first time that creature fails an ability check, attack roll, or saving throw it is overcome with self-hatred and takes 2d6 psychic damage.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/description&gt;		
