			&lt;p&gt;You can use a bonus action and spend 2 ectoplasm points to cause a creature you can see within 60 feet to experience paralyzing fear. When you do, that creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be frightened of you until the end of its next turn. While it is frightened of you, its movement speed is reduced to 0.&lt;/p&gt;
