			&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;When you make a Insight ability check to understand a creature’s self-hatred, you can spend 1 ectoplasm point to gain advantage on that ability check.&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
		&amp;lt;/sheet&amp;gt;
	&amp;lt;/element&amp;gt;
